# Trial-Size Trial by Wind (battlefield.trial_size_trial_by_wind): entryRequirement. Main, a level 20 Warrior with the quest accepted and
# the MiniTuningForkOfWind: WP_Entrance: not a Summoner: no options: the default. bob, a level 19 Summoner: below 20: no options.
lists CloisterOfGales/WP_Entrance/onTrade
char zone=CloisterOfGales pos=-357.6,-0.1,-380.0 job=WAR lvl=20
char bob zone=CloisterOfGales pos=-357.6,-0.1,-380.0 job=SMN lvl=19
quest Outlands.TrialSizeTrialByWind accepted
item MiniTuningForkOfWind
bob: item MiniTuningForkOfWind
login
trade WP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfWind x1  # not a Summoner: no options
bob: login
bob: trade WP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfWind x1  # level 19: no options
